<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>愿由ъ옄 ??쒕낫??/title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    body {
      background: #f3f5fb;
      color: #1f2937;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;
      padding: 28px 16px;
    }
    .wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .card-soft {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .card-soft h2 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .meta-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .meta-cell {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }
    .meta-cell .label { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.72rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .meta-cell .value { font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; }
    .badge-soft {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .badge-soft.on  { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .badge-soft.off { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
    .badge-soft.run { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
    table.subs { font-size: 0.88rem; }
    table.subs th { font-weight: 600; color: #475569; font-size: 0.78rem; }
    table.subs td { vertical-align: middle; }
    .topbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .topbar h1 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="topbar">
      <h1><i class="bi bi-speedometer2 me-2"></i>愿由ъ옄 ??쒕낫??/h1>
      <a href="/admin/logout" class="text-decoration-none text-secondary small">
        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right me-1"></i>濡쒓렇?꾩썐
      </a>
    </div>

    <% if (flash) { %>
      <%
        const flashMap = {
          missing_email: { type: "danger", msg: "?대찓?쇱씠 鍮꾩뼱 ?덉뒿?덈떎." },
          not_found: { type: "danger", msg: "?대떦 ?대찓?쇱쓣 李얠쓣 ???놁뒿?덈떎." },
          removed: { type: "success", msg: "援щ룆?먮? ?쒓굅?덉뒿?덈떎." },
          pattern_seeding: { type: "warning", msg: "?⑦꽩 ?쒕뱶媛 ?대? 吏꾪뻾 以묒엯?덈떎." },
          pattern_seed_started: { type: "success", msg: "?⑦꽩 ?쒕뱶瑜??쒖옉?덉뒿?덈떎 (4~8遺??뚯슂). ?덈줈怨좎묠?쇰줈 吏꾪뻾 ?뺤씤." },
          pattern_analyzing: { type: "warning", msg: "?⑦꽩 遺꾩꽍???대? 吏꾪뻾 以묒엯?덈떎." },
          pattern_analyze_started: { type: "success", msg: "?⑦꽩 遺꾩꽍???쒖옉?덉뒿?덈떎 (~1遺?. ?꾨즺 ??/pattern ?섏씠吏?먯꽌 寃곌낵 ?뺤씤." },
          mail_sent: { type: "success", msg: "VVI ?좏샇 硫붿씪??諛쒖넚?덉뒿?덈떎." },
          no_result: { type: "danger", msg: "pattern-result.json ?뚯씪???놁뒿?덈떎. 癒쇱? 遺꾩꽍???ㅽ뻾?섏꽭??" },
          mail_error: { type: "danger", msg: "硫붿씪 諛쒖넚 以??ㅻ쪟媛 諛쒖깮?덉뒿?덈떎." },
        };
        const f = flashMap[flash];
      %>
      <% if (f) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-<%= f.type %> small"><%= f.msg %></div>
      <% } %>
    <% } %>

    <div class="card-soft">
      <h2><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>?댁쁺 ?곹깭</h2>
      <div class="meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-cell">
          <div class="label">援щ룆??/div>
          <div class="value"><%= subscribers.length %> / <%= maxSubscribers %></div>
        </div>
        <% if (typeof stocksMaster !== 'undefined' && stocksMaster) { %>
          <div class="meta-cell">
            <div class="label">醫낅ぉ 留덉뒪??/div>
            <div class="value">
              <% if (stocksMaster.stale) { %>
                <span class="badge-soft run"><%= stocksMaster.ageDays %>??????/span>
              <% } else { %>
                <%= stocksMaster.ageDays %>????              <% } %>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
      <% if (typeof seededCount !== 'undefined') { %>
        <div class="meta-cell mt-2">
          <div class="label">李⑦듃 ?쒕뱶 醫낅ぉ</div>
          <div class="value"><%= seededCount %> 醫낅ぉ ???쇰큺 罹먯떆 (cache/stock-charts-long)</div>
        </div>
      <% } %>
      <div class="alert alert-info small mt-2 mb-0">
        ?꾩옱 硫붿씤 紐⑤뜽: <strong>QVA_HIGHER_LOW</strong> (????곸듅 + 嫄곕옒?湲?利앷?) + <strong>QVA_EVOLUTION</strong> (援ъ“ 吏꾪솕 ?꾪꽣) = <strong>QVA_STRONG</strong> (理쒖슦??
        + <strong>VVI</strong> (嫄곕옒?湲?珥덈룞 + ?좏샇 異붿쟻) ???뱀뀡留??⑦꽩 ?섏씠吏???쒖떆.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-soft">
      <h2><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow me-1"></i>醫낅ぉ 遺꾩꽍 ?뚯씠?꾨씪??/h2>
      <div class="small text-secondary mb-3">
        <strong>???쒕뱶</strong>: KRX ?쇰큺 李⑦듃 ?곗씠???ㅼ슫濡쒕뱶 (cache 媛깆떊) 쨌
        <strong>??遺꾩꽍</strong>: <code>analyzeAll()</code> ?몄텧 = QVA_HIGHER_LOW + QVA_EVOLUTION 湲곗? ?щ텇??(cache/pattern-result.json ?낅뜲?댄듃, /pattern ?섏씠吏 諛섏쁺) 쨌
        <strong>???쇱씪 ?낅뜲?댄듃</strong>: pykrx + Naver 理쒓렐 5嫄곕옒??李⑦듃/?섍툒 媛깆떊 + ?щ텇??(留ㅼ씪 16:20 ?먮룞 ?ㅽ뻾)
        <br>??肄붾뱶 諛고룷 ?꾩뿏 諛섎뱶??<strong>??遺꾩꽍</strong>???ㅼ떆 ?ㅽ뻾?댁빞 /pattern ?섏씠吏??諛섏쁺?⑸땲??
      </div>
      <% if (typeof patternState !== 'undefined' && patternState) { %>
        <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="meta-cell">
              <div class="label">?쒕뱶 ?곹깭</div>
              <div class="value">
                <% if (patternState.seeding) { %>
                  <span class="badge-soft run">吏꾪뻾 以?/span>
                  <% if (patternState.seedProgress?.total) { %>
                    <span class="text-secondary small ms-2"><%= patternState.seedProgress.i %>/<%= patternState.seedProgress.total %> 쨌 <%= patternState.seedProgress.code %> <%= patternState.seedProgress.name %></span>
                  <% } %>
                <% } else if (patternState.seedFinishedAt) { %>
                  <span class="badge-soft on">?꾨즺</span>
                  <span class="text-secondary small ms-2"><%= new Date(patternState.seedFinishedAt).toLocaleString("ko-KR", { timeZone: "Asia/Seoul" }) %></span>
                <% } else { %>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">誘몄떎??/span>
                <% } %>
                <% if (patternState.seedError) { %>
                  <div class="text-danger small mt-1"><%= patternState.seedError %></div>
                <% } %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="meta-cell">
              <div class="label">遺꾩꽍 ?곹깭</div>
              <div class="value">
                <% if (patternState.analyzing) { %>
                  <span class="badge-soft run">吏꾪뻾 以?/span>
                <% } else if (patternState.analyzeFinishedAt) { %>
                  <span class="badge-soft on">?꾨즺</span>
                  <span class="text-secondary small ms-2"><%= new Date(patternState.analyzeFinishedAt).toLocaleString("ko-KR", { timeZone: "Asia/Seoul" }) %></span>
                <% } else { %>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">誘몄떎??/span>
                <% } %>
                <% if (patternState.analyzeError) { %>
                  <div class="text-danger small mt-1"><%= patternState.analyzeError %></div>
                <% } %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="meta-cell">
              <div class="label">?쇱씪 ?낅뜲?댄듃 ?곹깭</div>
              <div class="value">
                <% if (patternState.dailyUpdating) { %>
                  <span class="badge-soft run">遺꾩꽍以?/span>
                  <span class="text-secondary small ms-2">??20~30遺??뚯슂 (李⑦듃 + ?섍툒 + 遺꾩꽍)</span>
                <% } else if (patternState.dailyUpdateFinishedAt) { %>
                  <span class="badge-soft on">遺꾩꽍??/span>
                  <span class="text-secondary small ms-2"><%= new Date(patternState.dailyUpdateFinishedAt).toLocaleString("ko-KR", { timeZone: "Asia/Seoul" }) %></span>
                <% } else { %>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">誘몄떎??/span>
                <% } %>
                <% if (patternState.dailyUpdateError) { %>
                  <div class="text-danger small mt-1"><%= patternState.dailyUpdateError %></div>
                <% } %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% } %>
      <div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <form method="post" action="/admin/pattern/seed" class="m-0" onsubmit="return confirm('??李⑦듃 ?쒕뱶瑜??ㅼ떆 ?ㅽ뻾?좉퉴?? 湲곗〈 罹먯떆???좎?, ?좉퇋 醫낅ぉ留?異붽? (~10遺?.');">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" <%= (typeof patternState !== 'undefined' && patternState?.seeding) ? 'disabled' : '' %>>
            <i class="bi bi-cloud-download me-1"></i>??李⑦듃 ?쒕뱶 (KRX ?쇰큺)
          </button>
        </form>
        <form method="post" action="/admin/pattern/analyze" class="m-0" onsubmit="return confirm('??遺꾩꽍???ㅼ떆 ?ㅽ뻾?좉퉴?? QVA_HIGHER_LOW + QVA_EVOLUTION 湲곗? ?щ텇????/pattern ?섏씠吏 諛섏쁺 (~1遺?.');">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success btn-sm" <%= (typeof patternState !== 'undefined' && patternState?.analyzing) ? 'disabled' : '' %>>
            <i class="bi bi-cpu me-1"></i>??遺꾩꽍 ?ㅽ뻾 (QVA_STRONG)
          </button>
        </form>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm"
          <%= (typeof patternState !== 'undefined' && patternState?.dailyUpdating) ? 'disabled' : '' %>
          onclick="runDailyUpdate()">
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-1"></i>???쇱씪 ?낅뜲?댄듃
        </button>
        <form method="post" action="/admin/send-pattern-mail" class="m-0" onsubmit="return confirm('VVI ?좏샇 硫붿씪??吏湲?諛쒖넚?좉퉴??');">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-warning btn-sm">
            <i class="bi bi-envelope-check me-1"></i>??VVI ?좏샇 硫붿씪 諛쒖넚
          </button>
        </form>
        <a href="/pattern" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">
          <i class="bi bi-eye me-1"></i>/pattern 蹂닿린
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="small text-secondary mt-2">
        ????肄붾뱶 諛고룷 吏곹썑??<strong>??遺꾩꽍 ?ㅽ뻾</strong> 留??꾨Ⅴ硫??⑸땲?? ?쒕뱶??KRX ?쇰큺 媛깆떊???꾩슂???뚮쭔.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-soft">
      <h2><i class="bi bi-people me-1"></i>援щ룆??(<%= subscribers.length %>)</h2>
      <% if (subscribers.length === 0) { %>
        <div class="small text-muted">援щ룆?먭? ?놁뒿?덈떎.</div>
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="table-responsive">
          <table class="table table-sm subs align-middle">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>?대찓??/th>
                <th>援щ룆??/th>
                <th class="text-end">愿由?/th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <% subscribers.forEach(function(sub) { %>
                <tr>
                  <td><%= sub.email %></td>
                  <td>
                    <% if (sub.subscribedAt) { %>
                      <%= new Date(sub.subscribedAt).toLocaleString("ko-KR", { timeZone: "Asia/Seoul" }) %>
                    <% } else { %>
                      <span class="text-muted">-</span>
                    <% } %>
                  </td>
                  <td class="text-end">
                    <form method="post" action="/admin/unsubscribe" class="d-inline" onsubmit="return confirm('<%= sub.email %> ??瑜? 援щ룆 ?댁젣?좉퉴??');">
                      <input type="hidden" name="email" value="<%= sub.email %>" />
                      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm">
                        <i class="bi bi-x-circle"></i>
                      </button>
                    </form>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              <% }); %>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center small text-secondary mt-3">
      <a href="/" class="text-decoration-none text-secondary me-3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i>?덉쑝濡?/a>
      <a href="/subscribe" class="text-decoration-none text-secondary"><i class="bi bi-envelope-plus me-1"></i>援щ룆 ?섏씠吏</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    async function runDailyUpdate() {
      const msg = '?쇱씪 ?낅뜲?댄듃瑜??ㅽ뻾?좉퉴?? (李⑦듃 + ?섍툒 + 遺꾩꽍, ??20~30遺??뚯슂)';
      if (!confirm(msg)) return;

      try {
        const resp = await fetch('/admin/run-daily-update', { method: 'POST' });
        if (resp.ok) {
          // ?쒕쾭 ?곹깭 ?낅뜲?댄듃 ?湲????섏씠吏 ?덈줈怨좎묠 (300ms)
          setTimeout(() => {
            location.reload();
          }, 300);
        } else {
          alert('?붿껌 ?ㅽ뙣: ' + resp.status);
        }
      } catch (e) {
        alert('?ㅻ쪟: ' + e.message);
      }
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
